{"id":"60fb71c52244db74","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-ReverseMathematics.md","title":"Collection of Reversal Pairs","display":"df-ReverseMathematics — Collection of Reversal Pairs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-ReverseMathematics","aliases":["62-df-ReverseMathematics"],"display":"df-ReverseMathematics — Collection of Reversal Pairs","depends_on":["[[62-df-reverse-mathematics]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.9 (local relational presentation)","source_pages":[32,33,34],"source_pdf_pages":[50,51,52]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-ReverseMathematics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-ReverseMathematics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ReverseMathematics — Collection of Reversal Pairs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dd5fa36b013f76e\" href=\"?note=0dd5fa36b013f76e\" title=\"62-df-reverse-mathematics\">62-df-reverse-mathematics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.9 (local relational presentation)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span><span>33</span><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span><span>51</span><span>52</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(T_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dd5fa36b013f76e\" href=\"?note=0dd5fa36b013f76e\" title=\"62-df-reverse-mathematics\">62-df-reverse-mathematics</a>。以下有序对是元层集合论有序对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ReverseMathematics}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{RM}_{S_2}(T_0)\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2})\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}:\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}(T,\\varphi;T_0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ReverseMathematics}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{RM}_{S_2}(T_0)\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\varphi)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2})\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}:\\operatorname{Reversal}_{S_2}(T,\\varphi;T_0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>小写文件定义单个反演关系，本文件定义反演对的元层集合，保留两个原链接及不同接口。它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 的第三阶对象，也不声称书中存在这个命名的集合。只收录已成立的理论等价；普通数学命题是否值得研究另属选题判断。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.9 (local relational presentation)；纸面页 32, 33, 34；PDF 页 50, 51, 52。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-reverse-mathematics","status":"resolved","id":"0dd5fa36b013f76e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-reverse-mathematics]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"